 This project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
 
+## Unreleased
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Security: when `{ requireWellFormed: true }` is passed, `XMLSerializer.serializeToString()` now validates every serialized attribute qualified name (including synthesized `xmlns:PREFIX` namespace declarations) against the XML `QName` production and throws `InvalidStateError` otherwise. Previously, names set via `Element.setAttribute()` (which does not validate) were emitted verbatim, allowing attribute injection. Default serialization is unchanged. [`GHSA-4w3w-2rp5-g8jm`](https://github.com/xmldom/xmldom/security/advisories/GHSA-4w3w-2rp5-g8jm)
+
 ## [0.9.10](https://github.com/xmldom/xmldom/compare/0.9.9...0.9.10)
 
 ### Fixed
